OL,4,CNew theatre will be a venue for all,   
OL,5,Csay bosses                             
OL,6,GBosses behind a new #16m arts venue in 
OL,7,GWorcester have insisted it will be a   
OL,8,G"centre for everyone" - after it       
OL,9,Greached another milestone.             
OL,11,FThe keys to the Scala Theatre have     
OL,12,Fbeen handed to the charity that will   
OL,13,Frun it by developer Speller Metcalfe,  
OL,14,Fahead of next summer's expected        
OL,15,Fopening.                               
OL,17,FThe BBC was given a tour inside the    
OL,18,Fhistoric building, whose refurbishment 
OL,19,Fis nearing completion and will feature 
OL,20,Fthree state-of-the-art performance     
OL,21,Fspaces.                                
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
