OL,4,C'They thought I was crazy when I       
OL,5,Cbought a farm'                         
OL,6,GA man who was told he was crazy when   
OL,7,Ghe bought a farm more than a decade    
OL,8,Gago has had the last laugh by being    
OL,9,Gnamed Farmer of the Year.              
OL,11,FLee Gilbert, from Market Drayton,      
OL,12,Falready had a couple of other          
OL,13,Fsuccessful firms under his belt in     
OL,14,F2015, but said people still questioned 
OL,15,Fwhy he had gone "into an industry      
OL,16,Fwhich has got a very long term payback 
OL,17,Fon it".                                
OL,19,FHe also said there were doubts from    
OL,20,Fthe local community, because he did    
OL,21,F"not come from farming stock".         
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
